{
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "title": "1. Overview",
      "text": "%md\n## 1. Overview\n\n**Production-risk warning:** this educational notebook directly replaces `lakehouse.silver.gh_sessions`, does not write production provenance, and is not serialized with the flatten stage. Running it can invalidate downstream generation checks. Production writes must use the `gh_archive_flatten_sessionization` DAG/application.",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "2. Setup",
      "text": "%md\n## 2. Setup",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "2. Setup (code)",
      "text": "%spark\nimport spark.implicits._\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions._\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.expressions.Window",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "3. Read",
      "text": "%md\n## 3. Read",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "3. Read (code)",
      "text": "%spark\nval events = spark.table(\"lakehouse.silver.gh_events\").select(\n  $\"id\", $\"type\", $\"actor_login\", $\"repo_name\", $\"created_at\"\n)",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "4. Transform",
      "text": "%md\n## 4. Transform",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "4. Transform (code)",
      "text": "%spark\nval w = Window.partitionBy($\"actor_login\").orderBy($\"created_at\", $\"id\")\nval cumulative = w.rowsBetween(Window.unboundedPreceding, Window.currentRow)\nval gaps = events\n  .withColumn(\"previous_created_at\", lag($\"created_at\", 1).over(w))\n  .withColumn(\"new_session\", when(\n    $\"previous_created_at\".isNull ||\n      (unix_timestamp($\"created_at\") - unix_timestamp($\"previous_created_at\")) > 1800,\n    lit(1)\n  ).otherwise(lit(0)).cast(\"int\"))\nval sessions = gaps\n  .withColumn(\"session_id\", sum($\"new_session\").over(cumulative).cast(\"long\"))\n  .select($\"id\", $\"type\", $\"actor_login\", $\"repo_name\", $\"created_at\",\n    $\"previous_created_at\", $\"new_session\", $\"session_id\")",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "5. Write",
      "text": "%md\n## 5. Write",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "5. Write (code)",
      "text": "%spark\nsessions.writeTo(\"lakehouse.silver.gh_sessions\").using(\"iceberg\").createOrReplace()",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "6. Verify",
      "text": "%md\n## 6. Verify",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "6. Verify (code)",
      "text": "%spark\nspark.sql(\"SELECT actor_login, count(distinct session_id) AS sessions FROM lakehouse.silver.gh_sessions GROUP BY actor_login ORDER BY sessions DESC\").show(false)",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    }
  ],
  "name": "sessionization-gh_archive-spark-iceberg",
  "id": "sessionization-gh_archive-spark-iceberg",
